      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00592",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"真是一群傻瓜！\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"What a bunch of fools!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00592",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "柏木不服气，不让人听清楚似地说，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kashiwagi said resentfully, as if making sure no one could hear him clearly,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00592",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "\"那种丑态究竟是什么玩意儿？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"What in the world is that disgraceful display?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00592",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "那帮家伙难道健康吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Are those people supposed to be healthy?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00592",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "既然如此，在别人面前炫耀健康又有什么价值呢？\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If so, what value is there in showing off one's health in front of others?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
